			"url": "https://github.com/withastro/roadmap/discussions/1246",
			"summary": "A maintainer proposes deprecating and then removing `define:vars` on script elements (keeping it on styles), because it forces unbundled inline scripts, repeats them per component, blocks inline-script optimisation and CSP work, and has documented alternatives; a new data-passing API is out of scope, and he estimates a two-year deprecation given about twelve thousand public usages.",
